# cn-telemetry-collectors — STABLE list (source of truth)
#
# One entry per line. Fields (pipe-separated):
#   domain   — collection endpoint hostname (exact; NOT a marketing/company domain)
#   sources  — independent list sources that corroborate the domain
#   evidence — probe fingerprint or other verification (see CONTRIBUTING.md)
#   added    — date the entry was promoted to STABLE
#
# Admission rules (either path qualifies, see CONTRIBUTING.md):
#   A) corroborated by >= 2 independent public tracking lists
#   B) documented SDK collection endpoint + probe fingerprint match
#
# Editing: additions to this file happen ONLY via promotion from QUARANTINE.domains.
# Removals: open a PR with the reason (source drop, breakage report, or probe reversal).
# Generated artifacts (dist/) are compiled from this file — never edit those directly.

# --- CN collection endpoints (rule B: SDK-documented + probed) ---
alog.umeng.com | umeng-sdk-docs,manual | probe:http GET /=500/0B,/pixel=500/0B (endpoint alive, no route at /) | 2026-11-17
applog.snssdk.com | bytedance-applog-docs,manual | probe:http GET /=404/144B,/pixel=404/144B (tiny 404, no functional content) | 2026-11-17
log.snssdk.com | bytedance-applog-docs,manual | probe:http GET /=504/158B (alive gateway, no functional content) | 2026-11-17
sdk.talkingdata.com | talkingdata-sdk-docs,manual | probe:http GET /=200/277B,/pixel=404/368B (tiny responses only) | 2026-11-17

# --- Global collection endpoints (rule A: shavar:Analytics + easyprivacy) ---
www.google-analytics.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | probe:http GET /collect?v=1&t=pageview=200/35B (beacon-shaped 2xx-tiny; note GET / serves 118KB marketing page — path-shaped probing is mandatory) | 2026-11-17
ssl.google-analytics.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (http probe connection-refused is expected) | 2026-11-17
api.mixpanel.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | probe:http GET /=404/90B,/collect=404/127B (tiny 404s, no functional content) | 2026-11-17
api.segment.io | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint | 2026-11-17
api.amplitude.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint | 2026-11-17
bam.nr-data.net | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (New Relic event ingest) | 2026-11-17
insights-collector.newrelic.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (New Relic browser agent collector) | 2026-11-17
in.hotjar.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (Hotjar ingest) | 2026-11-17
ping.chartbeat.net | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (Chartbeat ping) | 2026-11-17
pixel.parsely.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src; https-only endpoint (Parse.ly pixel) | 2026-11-17
analytics.yahoo.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src | 2026-11-17
pixel.barion.com | shavar:Analytics,easyprivacy | 2src | 2026-11-17
